## 📊 API Endpoints

### Графики
```
GET /api/chart/{sec_id}
    ?interval=5|60|1440
    &period=1d|1w|1m|3m|6m|1y|all
    &clgroup=FIZ|YUR
```

### Инструменты
```
GET /api/instruments
    ?search=SBER
    &limit=100
    &offset=0
```

### Открытый интерес
```
GET /api/oi/{sec_id}
    ?interval=5|60|1440
    &period=1d|1w|1m|3m|6m|1y|all
    &variant=oi|long|short|net
```

### Тепловая карта
```
GET /api/heatmap/stocks
    ?size_by=volume|value_1d|value_1m
    &color_by=change_1d|change_1m
    &group_by=sector|none
```

### Статистика
```
GET /api/stats/overview
GET /api/stats/top_movers
```

